{{define "welcome_dm" -}}
## Welcome to CA Global! 👋
To help everyone recognize you, please set your server nickname. It uses the format `TrainerName Flag Community`, for example `Ash 🇩🇪 Kanto CA` (enter `DE` as the country code).

Tap the button below to set it now, a short form will pop up where you can enter your trainer name, 2-letter country code (ISO alpha-2), and community. You can change it any time with the `/set-nickname` command in the server.
{{- end}}

{{define "nickname_panel" -}}
## Set your nickname
Use the button below to set your server nickname in the format:
`TrainerName Flag Community`
Enter a 2-letter country code (ISO alpha-2), for example `DE` for 🇩🇪.
{{- end}}

